  "worded": "1. Up: v² = 2a_u s. Down: (v/2)² = 2a_d s. So a_d = a_u/4.\n\n2. As in Q20, this gives μ = (3/5) tan 30° = √3/5 ≈ 0.3464.\n\n3. N = 346.",
